# Internal helper -- NOT meant to be run standalone via IC.
# PCALLed by VVDN_35L35R_COORDINATED_OPS.scn when VDN701 (the SAME-
# numbered departure whose takeoff roll VDN601's own touchdown triggered)
# crosses the real RWY 35R far-end reference point 16.0574,108.1984 --
# i.e. once the runway is confirmed clear, VDN601 (currently holding at
# 16.0489,108.1987) is cleared to cross RWY 35R and continue taxiing to
# Gate 26 (16.05262199,108.2019728, real coordinate), then DEL 10s after
# reaching the gate (per explicit request).

